    <system:String x:Key="Settings.Agent.Conversation.MaxToolRoundsHint">Upper bound on model round-trips within a single reply. Once it runs out the reply stops mid-task and you have to say “continue” to resume. Raise it when running long multi-step skills.</system:String>
